Subject: [PATCH] Live mode toggle UI: clickable demo/live switcher in header
 with settings popover

- Add radio-button-style mode toggle (demo/live) in header next to logo
- Add settings gear popover with backend URL and baseline checkbox
- Default to live mode on localhost and run.app (not just run.app)
- Add "Switch to demo" recovery link in live backend error messages
- Remove Claude/AI references from CHANGELOG
- Update test assertion to match new settings popover text

